<title>USA: Sioux Falls feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers not well tested, compared to last Thursday, USDA said. A few were $1.00-$2.00 per cwt lower. 84 percent over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Steers - Medium and Large 1 - Small consignment 537 lbs 88.00; 650-700 lbs 84.00-87.50. Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - Small consignment 569 lbs 84.00; Part load 784 lbs 74.50; Package 811 lbs 71.75; Fleshy 950-1000 lbs 62.75-66.00. Receipts - This Week 491 Last Week 1296 Last Year 674</p>
